**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Resource Delivery**

| Goal ID | Goal Title | Text (justification) | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation |
|---------|------------|-----------------------|--------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1 | Deliver Resources to Requesting Agent | *Achieve the delivery of required resources from storage to the requesting agent at the specified location.*  This is a **Perform** goal because it requires concrete actions (collection + delivery). | – | Perform | – |
| G2 | Collection Phase | *Execute all collection activities: determine order, navigate, request, wait, check battery, recharge if needed.*  It is a **Perform** goal – the robot must perform these tasks. | ; | Perform | AND |
| G2.1 | Determine Storage Order | *Query the optimal sequence of storage visits based on estimated waiting time and path length.*  This is a **Query** goal because it retrieves information. | – | Query | AND |
| G2.2 | Navigate to Storage | *Move robot to the selected storage location.*  A concrete action → **Perform**. | – | Perform | AND |
| G2.3 | Request Resource | *Send request message to storage with precise resource specification and wait for acknowledgment.*  Concrete action → **Perform**. | – | Perform | AND |
| G2.4 | Wait for Retrieval | *Wait until resources are retrieved from storage.*  Concrete action → **Perform**. | – | Perform | AND |
| G2.5 | Check Battery Level | *Query current battery level to decide if recharge is needed.*  This is a **Query** goal. | – | Query | AND |
| G2.6 | Recharge and Assign | *If battery low (10 %) in collection phase, go to recharging station and assign mission to another robot.*  Concrete actions → **Perform**. | ; | Perform | AND |
| G2.6.1 | Recharge Robot | *Go to recharging station and recharge.* | – | Perform | AND |
| G2.6.2 | Assign Mission to Another Robot | *Transfer remaining mission to another robot after recharge.* | – | Perform | AND |
| G3 | Delivery Phase | *Execute all delivery activities: navigate, deliver, check battery, return resource if needed, alert on failure.*  Concrete actions → **Perform**. | ; | Perform | AND |
| G3.1 | Navigate to Delivery Location | *Move robot to the delivery location.* | – | Perform | AND |
| G3.2 | Deliver Resource | *Deliver the collected resource to the requesting agent.* | – | Perform | AND |
| G3.3 | Check Battery Level | *Query current battery level during delivery to decide if return is needed.* | – | Query | AND |
| G3.4 | Return Resource to Checkpoint | *Return the resource to a checkpoint if battery low (30 %) in delivery phase.* | – | Perform | AND |
| G3.5 | Alert and Report | *If returning to checkpoint fails, trigger alert and send report to sector manager.*  This is a **Perform** goal that acts as a fallback for G3.4. | – | Perform | OR (fallback) |
| G3.6 | Assign Remaining Task to Another Robot | *After returning resource or alerting, assign remaining task to another robot that knows the resource position.* | – | Perform | AND |

